    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Stop missing calls.<br/>Start booking more jobs.</h1>
          <p class="sub">
            ClymbUp builds AI receptionists and automations for small home-service businesses
            so every lead gets captured, routed, and followed up — without hiring another office person.
          </p>

          <div class="tagline"><span class="dot"></span>Every call answered. Every lead captured. Every time.</div>

          <div class="ctaRow" id="contact">
            <a class="btn btnPrimary"
