              Book a strategy call →
            </a>

            <a class="btn btnGhost" href="tel:+17605655905">
              Call our AI agent (24/7) →
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="fine">
            Call <b>(760) 565-5905</b> anytime. It’s answered by our AI agent 24/7 — it can answer questions, run a live demonstration, and help you book a strategy call.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="card side">
          <h2>What you get</h2>
          <ul class="bullets">
            <li><b>AI receptionist</b> that answers, qualifies, and captures lead details.</li>
            <li><b>Lead routing</b> to the right person — instantly.</li>
            <li><b>Follow-up automation</b> so leads don’t die in voicemail.</li>
            <li><b>Operational support</b>: dispatch workflows, email triage, scheduling handoff.</li>
          </ul>

