            <b>Reality check:</b> if your phone goes to voicemail while you’re on a job, you’re donating revenue to your competitors.
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section id="what">
        <h2 class="sectionTitle">What we do</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>AI receptionist</h3>
            <p class="p">Answers calls, sounds professional, collects lead details, and routes the request.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Missed-call prevention</h3>
            <p class="p">You stay on the job. The agent stays on the phone. Leads don’t disappear.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Workflow automation</h3>
            <p class="p">Routing, summaries, follow-ups, email handling, dispatch workflows — built around your process.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="how">
        <h2 class="sectionTitle">How it works</h2>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="stepNum">1</div>
            <h3>We find the leakage</h3>
            <p class="p">Where calls get missed, where leads stall, where follow-up dies.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="stepNum">2</div>
            <h3>We build the system</h3>
            <p class="p">Voice agent + routing + summaries + follow-up automation. Simple. Effective.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="stepNum">3</div>
            <h3>We launch and tune</h3>
            <p class="p">We iterate until it reliably captures leads and drives booked jobs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="faq">
        <h2 class="sectionTitle">FAQ</h2>

        <details>
          <summary>Is this some annoying phone robot?</summary>
          <div class="p" style="margin-top:10px;">
            No. It’s designed to be short, natural, and useful. If it can’t help, it routes the call.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Can I try it right now?</summary>
          <div class="p" style="margin-top:10px;">
            Yes. Call <b>(760) 565-5905</b>. It’s answered 24/7 by our AI agent.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Do I have to change my business phone number?</summary>
          <div class="p" style="margin-top:10px;">
            Usually no. We typically forward calls from your existing number to the AI line and route back to you when needed.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>What’s the next step?</summary>
          <div class="p" style="margin-top:10px;">
            Call the AI line, then email to book a strategy call. We’ll map your workflow and show you the quickest win.
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:18px;">
        <div class="card">
          <h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:20px;">Ready to stop losing leads?</h2>
          <p class="p" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
